1 NAME Wǎn /HUANG 黄琬 84A/
2 GIVN Wǎn
2 _MARNM HUANG 黄琬 84A
1 NAME HUANG Wan, 黄琬 84A
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 141
1 DEAT
2 DATE 192
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 84th generation. 141 to 192. Eldest son of En Rong (恩荣). Lived in Jiang Xia An Lu (江夏安陆), present day Hubei An Lu (湖北安陆), during the Eastern Han (东汉) period. Also known as Zi Yan (子琰-字).
2 CONT
2 CONT Lost his father when he was a child. In 147, at age 7, accompanied his grandfather, Qiong (琼), to the Palace to explain about the solar eclipse to the Grand Empress (太后). Impressed the Imperial Court with his intelligence. Was mad
2 CONC e a Page (童子郎) and, in the early years of Zhongping (中平初, 184-189), became Governor of the area to the West of the capital. Subsequently appointed a Royal Helper (大匠少府大仆) and Magistrate of Yuzhou (豫州牧). Later appointed Chancellor/
2 CONC Prime Minister (太守), Minister of Education (司徒), Grand Commandant (太尉) and Marquis of Yang Quan (阳泉乡侯) during the Eastern Han Dynasty. Died in prison as a captive.
2 CONT
2 CONT Had 3 sons.
2 CONT
2 CONT 八十四世。公元141 - 公元192。恩荣之长子, 黄周之父。字子琰。
2 CONT
2 CONT 少而失父, 早而辩慧, 祖父琼, 初为魏郡太守。建和元年, 正月日食, 京师不见, 而琼以状闻, 太后诏问所食多少。琼思其对而未知所况。琬年七岁, 在旁曰, 何不言日食之余如月之初。琼大惊, 即以其言应诏, 而深奇爱之, 后拜童子郎。中平初 (公元184 - 公元189), 出为右扶风, 徵拜将作大匠少府大仆, 又为豫州牧, 及董卓秉政, 以琬名臣, 徵为司徒, 迁太尉, 更封阳泉乡侯。生三子, 季曰周。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT NB - An internet source indicates that Huang Wan (黄琬) had 11 sons. However, as he died at age 51, I have adopted the account of our Family Genealogy Book, Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu, (文明祖家谱) that Huang Wan had 3 sons.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Webpages on Huang Wan and 黄琬.
