1 NAME HUANG Zhou, 周 85A
1 SEX M
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 85th generation. 3rd and youngest son of Wan (琬). Also known as Ji Tong (季通-字). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Held several appointments (官壘曹).
2 CONT
2 CONT Had 5 sons. 2nd son was Zhong (忠).
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the Eastern Han (东汉) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT 八十五世。黄琬之幼子, 黄忠之父。字季通。
2 CONT
2 CONT 官壘曹。生五子, 次曰忠。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT NB - The historical records on his generation are varied and difficult to verify. I have adopted the record in our Family Genealogy Book, Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu, (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. 黄正瑞的博客.
