1 NAME Gōng Héng /HUANG 黄公衡 87A/
2 GIVN Gōng Héng
2 _MARNM HUANG 黄公衡 87A
1 NAME HUANG Gong Heng, 黄公衡 87A
1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 DATE 240
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 87th generation. ? to 240. 2nd and youngest son of Zhong (忠). Also known as Quan (权), Huang (隍-字), Jing Kai (靖楷-号) and  Dao Long (道隆-晚号). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Served under Liu Bei (刘备) and subsequently Cao Pi (曹丕) during the Three Kingdoms (三国) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Magistrate of Junshi region (郡史州牧) and became Zhennan General (镇南将军) during the reign of Emperor Wen  (Cao Pi)(文帝)(曹丕, 220-226). He was conferred the title of Marquis of Yu Yang (育阳侯) and appointed a royal consultant. In the third
2 CONC  year of Jingchu (景初三年, 239), he became Cheqi General (车骑将军). Was given the posthumous title of Jinghou (景侯).
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife was Madam Qiu (邱氏). Had 4 sons. Teng (腾) was his 2nd son.
2 CONT
2 CONT 八十七世。? - 公元240。忠之次子, 滕之父。号靖楷, 晚号道隆, 又名隍, 权。
2 CONT
2 CONT 少为郡史州牧, 文帝时拜为镇南将军, 封育阳侯, 加侍中。景初三年, 蜀延熙初, 迁车骑将军, 仪同三司, 谥景侯。
2 CONT
2 CONT 生四子, 次曰滕。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT NB - There are several versions of Huang Quan's (黄权) biography. According to our Family Genealogy Book, Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱), he had 4 sons and that Teng (腾) was his 2nd son. There was no mention of his wife. In the genealog
2 CONC y records of Huang Shou Gong (黄守恭), his wife was named as Madam Qiu (邱氏) and Teng was named as his only son. Huang Quan's birth and death dates were recorded as 210 and 280 respectively. However, several webpages of Huang Quan and
2 CONC  黄权 stated that he died in 240 but there was no record on when he was born. There was also mention that he had 2 sons - Huang Chong (黄崇) and Huang Yong (黄邕) (adopted) - who died without leaving any descendants. There was no mentio
2 CONC n of Teng or the 4th son. For the purpose of my Family Tree, I have adopted the record of our Family Genealogy Book that Teng was Huang Quan's descendant. I have also used the popular historical date of 240 as the date that Huang 
2 CONC Quan died.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Webpages on Huang Quan and 黄权.
