1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 89th generation. 255 to 340. Only son of Teng (腾). Name could be Zhi Lian (知连). Also known as Qian (潜) and Pi Wei (丕渭).
2 CONT
2 CONT Governor of Yong Le (永乐太守) during the Western Jin (西晋) period. Set up stockpiles of food to donate to the people and shared his income with his clansmen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife was Madam Zhan (詹氏). Had only one son - Yuan Fang (元芳).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 八十九世。公元255 - 公元340。腾之子, 元芳之父。又名知连, 潜或丕渭。
2 CONT
2 CONT 官永乐太守, 置义仓, 分俸给族。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
