2 _MARNM HUANG 黄元芳 90A
1 NAME HUANG Yuan Fang, 黄元芳 90A
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 280
1 DEAT
2 DATE 375
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 90th generation. 280 to 375. Son of Zhi Yun (知运). Also known as Yun (允), Yan Feng (彦丰-字) and Chang Xin (苌馨-号).
2 CONT
2 CONT When the Court (comprising of 8 clans) crossed the Chang Jiang (长江) during the Yong Jia (永嘉) period (307-313), he followed the Court into Min (闽) and was given charge of Jin An (晋安). Renowned for his spread of Taoist philosophy in
2 CONC  Min, he was bestowed the title of Duke of Min (闽国公). He ruled wisely and was conferred the posthumous title of Lord Wenjie (文节公).
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the Western Jin (西晋) and Eastern Jin (东晋) periods.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 2 wives - Madam Zhou (周氏) and Madam Chen (陈氏). Had one son - Zhong (仲). Died at age 95.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 九十世。公元280 - 公元375. 知运之子, 仲之父。又名允, 彦丰(字) 或苌馨(号)。
2 CONT
2 CONT 八姓入闽, 衣冠随永嘉(公元307 - 公元313)渡江来守晋安。后以道学倡闽, 封闽国公。听政施德及民, 谥文节公。享寿九十五。
2 CONT
2 CONT 配周陈二氏。子孙藩衍遍闽粤, 实为闽粤两者黄氏之始祖。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT NB - The name 黄元芳 is based on the record in my Family Genealogy Book, Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu, (文明祖家谱). Most websites show it as 黄元方. They both refer to the same person.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄元方 - 百度百科 
