1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 91st generation. 325 to 402. Only son of Yuan Fang (元芳). Also known as Biao Di (杓迪-字).
2 CONT
2 CONT Duke of Min (闽国公) during the Eastern Jin (东晋) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife was Madam He (何氏). Had 9 sons - Yong Jiu (雍旧), Yong Xin (雍新), Yong Tian (雍天), Yong Di (雍地), Yong Jin (雍金), Yong Mu (雍木), Yong Shui (雍水), Yong Huo (雍火) and Yong Tu (雍土).
2 CONT
2 CONT 九十一世。公元325 - 公元402。 元芳之子, 雍旧和其他八子之父。又名杓迪。
2 CONT
2 CONT 随父元芳公入闽, 封闽国公。
2 CONT
2 CONT 妻为何氏, 生九子 - 雍旧, 雍新, 雍天, 雍地, 雍金, 雍木, 雍水, 雍火, 雍土。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
