1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 92nd generation. 371 to 451. Eldest son of Zhong (仲). Name could be Yong Bo (雍伯). Also known as Bi (泌-諱), Wei (伟-字) and Hong Bo (泓伯-号).
2 CONT
2 CONT Well versed in classics and history. A Court Historian (太史) during the Eastern Jin (东晋) and Sixteen Kingdoms (十六朝) periods. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife was Madam Chen (陈氏). Had 4 sons - Ru Zhang (如章), Ru Yi (如意), Ru Shi (如诗) and Ru Wen (如文).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 九十二世。公元371 - 公元451。仲之长子, 如意之父。又名泌(諱), 伟(字)或弘伯(号)。
2 CONT
2 CONT 东晋十六朝时经史博览, 官至太史。
2 CONT
2 CONT 配陈氏, 生四子 - 如章, 如意, 如诗, 如文。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
