1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 93rd generation. 399 to 502. 2nd son of Yong Jiu (雍旧). Also known as Kui (奎-字).
2 CONT
2 CONT Refused officialdom (徵召不受) and lived as a recluse (隐者) during the Northern and Southern Dynasties (南北朝).
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Madam Hu (胡氏) and had 4 sons - Xi (西), Qi (齐), Fu (赋) and Xin (辛).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 九十三世。公元399 - 公元502。雍旧之子, 齐之父。
2 CONT
2 CONT 隐者, 徵召不受, 及举孝廉, 为乐官舍人。
2 CONT
2 CONT 配胡氏, 生四子 - 西, 齐, 赋, 辛。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
