1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 100th generation. 627 to 710. Eldest son of Fang (芳). Also known as Shou Chong (守冲) and Shi Qian (士谦-字).
2 CONT
2 CONT An Imperial Librarian (秘书监) and recluse (隐者) during the Tang (唐) Dynasty (618 -907). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Had 2 wives - Madam Su (苏氏) and Madam Hu (胡氏) and 2 sons - An (岸) and Ya (崖).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 一百世。公元627 - 公元710。芳之长子, 岸之父。字士谦, 又名守冲。
2 CONT
2 CONT 唐时 (公元618 - 公元907) 隐者。妻为苏氏和胡氏, 生二子 - 岸, 崖。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
