1 NAME 岸 Àn /HUÁNG 黃/
2 GIVN 岸 Àn
2 _MARNM HUÁNG 黃
1 NAME HUÁNG Àn, 黃岸,101,95世
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 674
1 DEAT
2 DATE 756
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 101st generation. 674 - 756. Eldest son of Chong (冲). Also known as Zong Ji (宗极-字), Kuei Jie (魁杰-别字) and Yan Zhong (彦忠-号).
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived in Huangzhou Jiangxia (黄州江夏) in Hubei (湖北) during his early years. Then moved to Guangzhou Gushi (光州固始) in Henan (河南). Subsequently moved to Houguan County (侯官县), present day Fuzhou East Street Nanhou Street (福州东街南后街) in Fuj
2 CONC ian (福建). Finally settled in Quanzhou Commandery Puyang County (泉州郡莆阳县).
2 CONT
2 CONT Reputed for his good looks and scholastic skills since young.
2 CONT
2 CONT Started as an Imperial Librarian (秘书监). Became a Top Scholar (全科及第) in 698. Appointed Governor of Guizhou (桂州刺史) in Guangxi (广西) during the reign of Tang Xuan Zong (唐玄宗). Retired in 755 and conferred the title of Duke of Min (闽国公)
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Madam Qiu (丘氏) and  Madam Zhao (赵氏) and had 3 sons - Yao (謡), Dian (典) and Le (乐).
2 CONT
2 CONT His grave is in Putien, Fujian (福建莆田).
2 CONT
2 CONT More than 310,000 people in Putien  are descendants of Huang An. In Hainan province his descendants have reached more than 1.8 million. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He is credited with two generation poems that are widely used in Chao Shan (潮汕), Guangdong (广东) - Dun Ben Xun Liang, Shao Xian Yi Fan, Xi Xian Hui Guang, Kang Qiang Feng Ji, He Shun Zhi Xiang (敦本循良, 绍先懿范, 锡羡辉光, 康强逢吉, 和顺致祥) and Wen
2 CONC  Zhang Hua Guo, Shi Li Chuan Jia, Ming De Qi Hou, Yi Shi Qi Chang (文章华国, 诗礼传家, 明德启后, 奕世其昌)..
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 101世。公元674 - 公元756。冲之长子, 典之父。字宗极, 别字魁杰, 号彦忠。
2 CONT
2 CONT 公元698登进士, 官历史官编修, 徐州牧, 升广西桂州刺史。自福唐侯官 (今福州东街口南后街) 黄巷迁入莆阳县延寿里国欢院 (今莆田市涵江区国欢镇黄霞村黄巷自然村), 定居莆田, 黄岸为入莆黄姓之始祖。
2 CONT
2 CONT 娶丘氏和赵氏, 生三子 - 谣, 典, 乐。长黄谣 (侯官县令) 及子孙在莆生活。次子黄典子孙主要分布广东南雄, 冈州 (地域相当于今开平, 台山, 江门和新会)。 季子黄乐子孙则遍布广西, 广东, 泉州等地。
2 CONT
2 CONT 黄岸墓, 莆田市文物保护单位, 位于福建省莆田市涵江区国欢镇黄霞村黄巷山国欢寺边。
2 CONT
2 CONT 黄岸子孙今在莆田 内的有31万人, 现居海南省的有180多万人。
2 CONT
2 CONT 黄安公制定的两套黄安公后裔字辈谱在潮汕和岭南一带都广泛流传 - 敦本循良, 绍先懿范, 锡羡辉光, 康祥逢吉, 和顺致祥；文章华国, 诗礼传家, 明德启后, 奕世其昌。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄元方 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. 黄正瑞的博客.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Websites on Huang An.
