1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 105th generation. 840 to 911. Son of Xiu (琇). Also known as Jian Dao (健道-字).
2 CONT
2 CONT A Scholar (进士) and  Court Official (大里正卿) during the Tang (唐) Dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT Had 3 sons - Hui Qing (微卿), Yang Qing (杨卿) and Chang Qing (昌卿).
2 CONT
2 CONT NB - An internet source under the name of Huang Yuan Fang (黄元方 - 百度百科) indicates that Tao (韬) married Madam Wu (吴氏) and had two sons - Bin Gong (彬恭) and Bin Jing (彬敬). Bin Gong (863 to 950) married Madam Chen (陈氏) and had 3 sons -
2 CONC  Hui Qing (微卿), Yang Qing (杨卿) and Chang Qing (昌卿). However, Bin Gong was not recorded in our Family Genealogy Book, Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu, (文明祖家谱). Instead, Huii Qing (微卿), Yang Qing (杨卿) and Chang Qing (昌卿)  were recorded as the so
2 CONC ns of Tao (韬). For the purpose of my Family Tree here, I have adopted the record of our Family Genealogy Book.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 105世。公元840 - 公元911。黄琇之子, 黄微卿之父。又名健道(字)。
2 CONT
2 CONT 唐昭宗895年赵观文榜进士。官大理正卿, 善属文, 有文集, 秀句集。
2 CONT
2 CONT 生三子 - 长微卿, 次扬卿,  三昌卿。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. 黄元方 - 百度百科
