1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 106th generation. 901 to 979. Eldest son of Tao (韬).
2 CONT
2 CONT  Born during the late Tang (唐后期) Dynasty. Well-educated (博学能文) but refused officialdom (不仕) during the Five Dynasties (五朝) period. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Madam Wang (王氏) and had 3 sons - Wei (纬), Shu (纾) and Ji (绩).
2 CONT
2 CONT NB - An Internet source (黄元方 - 百度百科) indicates that Hui Qing (徽卿) was the grandson of Tao (韬) and that his father was Bin Gong (彬恭). For the purpose of my Family Tree here, I have adopted the record in our Family Genealogy Book, W
2 CONC en Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱), that Hui Qing was the son of Tao.
2 CONT
2 CONT 106 世。公元901 - 公元979。黄韬之长子, 黄纾之父。
2 CONT
2 CONT 博学能文, 唐末不仕。
2 CONT
2 CONT 配王氏, 生三子 - 长曰纬, 次曰纾, 三曰绩。
2 CONT
2 CONT
