1 NAME HUÁNG Chāng, 黃昌,109,103世
1 SEX M
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 109th generation. 3rd son of De (德). Also known as Yong Sheng (永盛-字). 
2 CONT
2 CONT A Scholar (进士 - 1088) and Governor of Nanxiong (南雄太守) during the Northern Song (北宋) Dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT  Moved to Guangdong Nanxiong Prefecture, Baochang County, Shashui Village, Zhuji  Alley (广东南雄府保昌县沙水村珠玑巷).
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife was Madam Song (宋氏). Had 2 sons - Cheng Xi (澄溪) and Cheng Luo (澄洛).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 109世。黄德之三子。字永盛。
2 CONT
2 CONT 北宋1088年进士。官至南雄太守都漕运使, 迁居广东南雄府保昌县沙水村珠玑巷。
2 CONT
2 CONT 配宋氏, 生二子 - 长澄溪, 次澄落。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄元方 - 百度百科.
