1 NAME HUÁNG Chéng Luò, 黃澄洛,110,104世
1 SEX M
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 110th generation. 2nd and youngest son of Huang Chang (黄昌). Also known as Yun Gong (云公-諱), Yu Yuan (愈原-字) and Quan (荃).
2 CONT
2 CONT A Scholar (进士 - 1115) during the reign of Song Wei Zong (宋徽宗). Was a Censor (谏議大夫) and appointed  Magistrate (知府) of Guilin (桂林), Guangxi (广西)  during the Northern Song (北宋) Dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Madam Yin (殷氏). Moved to Putian  in Fujian (福建莆田). Had 2 sons - Ju Zheng (居正) and  Ju Fu (居富).
2 CONT
2 CONT Ju Zheng moved to Nanxiong Prefecture Zhuji Alley (南雄府珠玑巷), while Ju Fu remained in Putian County.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 110世。黄昌之次子。諱云公, 又名荃。字愈原。
2 CONT
2 CONT 北宋微宗1115年进士。历任谏议大夫, 广西桂林知府。由长州吴县醋库巷迁居福建莆田。
2 CONT
2 CONT 配殷氏, 生二子 - 黄由字居正, 黄田字居富。
2 CONT
2 CONT 居正迁回南雄府珠玑巷, 居富仍居福建莆田县。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱). 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄元方 - 百度百科.
