1 NAME HUANG Yuan Shen, WONG Jyun Sam, 黄源深, 112,106, 2世
1 NAME 源深 /黄/
2 GIVN 源深
2 SURN 黄
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1149
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1233
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 112th generation. 1149 to 1233. Eldest son of Ju Zheng (Geoi Zing) (居正) and Madam Wu (Mou Si) (巫氏). Born in Putian, Fujian (Fuk Gin Pou Tin) (福建莆田). Also known as Guang Han (Gwong Hon) (广汉-字) and Yun Shan (Wan Saan
2 CONC ) (云山-号).
2 CONT
2 CONT Achieved distinction of Scholar (Zeon Si) (进士) in 1181 during the reign of Song Xiao Zong (Sung Haau Zung) (宋孝宗). Appointed Magistrate (Zi Fu) (知府) of Xuzhou (Ceoi Zau) (徐州), then as Attendant Academician at Tianzhang Pavilion (天章
2 CONC 阁侍制), Chief Grain Transport Commissioner (Cou Wan Dou Jyu Si) (漕运都御史) of Zhejiang (Zit Gong) (浙江) and Vice Minister of Personnel ( 吏部侍郎) during the late Song (Sung Hau Kei) (宋后期) Dynasty. Posthumously conferred the title of Grand 
2 CONC Preceptor (赠少师). He migrated southward due to Mongol military advancing into the Southern Song territories and settled in Yuan Qing Fang Xiang Shan Tu Di Xiang (源清坊象山土地巷), current Du Ruan (杜阮) in Gangzhou (冈州), old name for Xinhui
2 CONC  (新会).
2 CONT
2 CONT 1st wife, Madam Mi (Mai Si) (米氏), bore him 4 sons - Guo Zong (Gwok Zung) (国宗), Guo Tai (Gwok Taai) (国泰), Guo An (Gwok Ngon) (国安) and Guo Bing (Gwok Bing) (国秉). 2nd wife, Madam Lin ( Lam Si) (林氏), bore him 2 sons - Guo Qi (Gwok Hei
2 CONC ) (国器) and Guo She (Gwok Se) (国舍). Madam Mi was a highly skilled physician and geomancer. She treated the then Empress Dowager Yang's breast disease successfully and was conferred the title Yi Ping Bang Xian Fu Ren (一品邦显夫人), the h
2 CONC ighest rank for a lady.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was buried in Du Hu (Dou Fuk) (都斛), in a special burial site known as Tong Tian Zhu (Tung Tin Zuk)) (通天烛) and Xian Ren Da Zuo (Sin Jan Da Zo) (先人打座). For many years, the grave could only be accessed by a 506-step stairway. As a
2 CONC  result of some damage to the stairway by a storm a few years ago, the stairway was repaired (reduced to 469 steps) and upgraded with ornamental concrete hand railings at a cost of more than RMB 1 million. A sculpture with the gol
2 CONC den character Huang (Wong) (黄) engraved on a huge concrete flag was erected near the Yun Shan Pavilion (Wan Saan Loeng Ting) (云山凉亭) at the car park. The grave site is more than 780 years old and enjoys a commanding view that stret
2 CONC ches to the South China Sea. According to geomancy, the surrounding landscape resembles a sitting immortal. The burial site was given the name Tong Tian Zhu because the main peak and the surrounding ones resemble candles reaching 
2 CONC to the sky/heaven. It is one of the four most famous and prestigious burial sites in Guangdong (Gwong Dung Sei Daai Ming Mou Dei) (广东四大名墓地). Every year hundreds and thousands of descendants locally and overseas come to pay their r
2 CONC espects at his grave during Qing Ming Jie (Cing Ming Zit) (清明節).
2 CONT
2 CONT 112世。公元1149 - 公元1233。居正公之长子, 国泰公之父。福建莆田人。字广汉, 号云山。
2 CONT
2 CONT 宋嘉定丁丑进士 (公元1181)。官任漕运都御史, 诰封中奉大夫。成淳九年除夕, 深公自南雄迁于广州府, 新会古冈州, 源清坊土地居焉。考復任南雄, 在旧家终, 享寿八十有五。
2 CONT
2 CONT 娶米氏和林氏, 生六子 - 国宗, 国泰, 国安, 国秉, 国器, 国舍。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Taishan Huang Shi Yin Long Zu Pu (台山黄氏隐龙族谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. 黄氏宗亲网 - 广东黄氏
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. 黄元方 (280 - 375).
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. 黄源深 - 百度百科.   
2 CONT
2 CONT 7.  www.cnts.gov.cn (中国.台山政府网)
2 CONT
2 CONT 8.  Grave site visits on 15 March 2019 and 22 October 2023.
2 CONT
2 CONT 9. Dun He Tang Huang Wu Cun Zu Pu (敦和堂黄屋村族谱）
