1 NAME 國宗 Guó Zōng /HUÁNG 黃/
2 GIVN 國宗 Guó Zōng
2 _MARNM HUÁNG 黃
1 NAME HUÁNG Guó Zōng, WONG Gwok Zung, 黃國宗,113,107,3世
1 SEX M
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 113th generation. Approximately 1171-1255.  Eldest son of Yuan Shen (Jyum Sam) (源深) and Madam Mi (Mai Si) (米氏). Also known as Chen Ding (諱-晨定) and An Dao (号-安道).
2 CONT
2 CONT Bestowed (赐) Imperial Scholar (Zeon Si) (进士) status  in 1193 during the 4th year of the reign of Song Guanzong (宋光宗). Held The Official Position (官任) of Secretary Of The Office Of Administrative Affairs of the Song Dynasty (皇宋經歴司)
2 CONC  in the capital.
2 CONT
2 CONT He initially resided In Shi Bei Du (石碑都) and Tan Ya Li (潭雅里). Both were historical administrative divisions in the vicinity of Xin Ning (新宁) (old name for Taishan, 台山. In his advanced age he moved with his son, Rui Gu (銳固), to Sha
2 CONC ping (沙坪) in Shuibu (水步). There is an ancestral temple dedicated to him there. Eventually, to avoid the advancing Mongol army,  Guozong moved with his son to Chaojing (潮境). His son Rui Gu is recognised as the first ancestor to mov
2 CONC e to Taishan (台山). Guozong famously said, once they arrived in Chaojing, that "no matter how the heaven
2 CONT and earth change, this place will always be free from worries!”
2 CONT
2 CONT His ancestral tablet (神位) is located in Jiangmen(江門)
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 2 woman, the first Lady Ma (馬氏) whom he had 4 sons - the eldest Ruigong (銳公), the second Ruitong (銳通), the third Ruigu (銳固) and the fourth Ruicong (銳聰); and Lady Lin (林氏) who bore him Ruizhi (銳智). Both his wives are bur
2 CONC ied together near Li Dong Cun (黎洞村), Taishan at place called Zhu Dong, Kong Feng Jian 朱洞, 孔峰尖. The tomb is described as Peacock spreading its tail (孔雀開屏形) and also called “Lantern hanging on a wall” (壁上掛燈形).
2 CONT
2 CONT 一百十三世. 约公元1171 - 约公元1255之间. 源深公長子,銳固公之父.諱晨定,号安道
2 CONT
2 CONT 宋光宗紹熙四年(1193年)癸卯科陳亮榜進士,官任經歷司
2 CONT
2 CONT 居石碑都潭雅里,後改沙坪,有祠
2 CONT
2 CONT 其墓在台山南坑喝作百足吐珠形庚向
2 CONT
2 CONT 夫人馬氏,生四子,長銳公,次銳通,三銳固,四銳聰.夫人林氏,生一子銳智.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT - Taishan Wong Zupu(台山黄氏族谱)
2 CONT - Bangka Huang Zupu(民國勿裡洋黄氏族譜)
2 CONT - Langxi Wong Zupu(朗溪今貌黄氏族谱)
2 CONT - Huang Wu Cun Wong Zupu(黄屋村黄氏族谱)
2 CONT - Visits To His Tomb
2 CONT
2 CONT Info By:Mike Wong(gen 32)
