1 NAME 鋭固 Ruì Gù /HUÁNG 黃/
2 GIVN 鋭固 Ruì Gù
2 _MARNM HUÁNG 黃
1 NAME HUÁNG Ruì Gù, 黃鋭固,114,108,4世
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1199
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1279
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 114th generation. Approximately 1199-1279. 4th son of Guo Zong (Gwok Zung) (国宗) and Madam Ma (馬氏). Also known as Zili (字-子立) and Pingqi (號-平器).
2 CONT
2 CONT Achieved Distinction Of Top Scholar (Zeon Si) (进士) in 1227 during the 3rd year of the reign of Emperor Lizong (宋理宗) during the Baoqing (寶慶) era. Held the Official Position (官任) of Secretary In The Office Of Administrative Affairs 
2 CONC In The Song Dynasty (皇宋經歷司).
2 CONT
2 CONT He is known as the first Huang ancestor who migrated to Taishan (台山l, having moved to Da Keng (大坑) in Chaojing (潮境). He brought his elderly father Guozong (国宗) to Chaojing (潮境) to avoid the advancing Mongol army during the late So
2 CONC uthern Song Dynasty. He also resided in various locations, including Beikeng(北坑) in Baisha (白沙), Hengjiang (橫江) in Daheng (大亨), Shaping (沙坪) in Shuibu (水步) and Changzhou (長洲) in Zhongshan (中山).
2 CONT
2 CONT His descendants lived in Chaojing (潮境) and Xi village (西村), eventually branching out and migrated to places like Enping (恩平), Huicheng (會城), Langxi (朗溪), Huang Wu village (黄屋村), 蚬岗 (Xian Gang) and other areas.
2 CONT
2 CONT His tomb is located in Nankeng (南坑), Taishan (台山), the terrain surrounding the tomb resembles a precious duck moving towards a pond (寶鴨下池形).
2 CONT
2 CONT He had 3 wives,the 1st Madam Cao (曹氏), the 2nd Madam Ma (馬氏)and the 3rd Madam Guan (关氏). Madam Ma (馬氏) bore him his only son (Cun Li 存礼).
2 CONT
2 CONT The Picture Added is a recreation of what this individual may have looked like
2 CONT
2 CONT 一百十四世. 约公元1199 - 约公元1279之间. 国宗公四子,存礼公之父.字子立,号平器
2 CONT
2 CONT 宋理宗皇寶慶三年(1227)宋鄉進士,官任經歷司
2 CONT
2 CONT 居台山潮境,白沙北坑,大亨橫江,沙坪水步,中山長洲
2 CONT
2 CONT 裔居潮境西村,後分遷會城,朗溪,黄屋村,恩平等地
2 CONT
2 CONT 其墓在台山南坑寶鴨下池形
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT - Taishan Wong Zupu(台山黄氏族谱)
2 CONT - Bangka Huang Zupu(民國勿裡洋黄氏族譜)
2 CONT - Langxi Wong Zupu(朗溪今貌黄氏族谱)
2 CONT - Chaojing Wong Zupu(潮境黄氏族谱)
2 CONT
2 CONT Info by:Mike Wong(gen 32)
