1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 114th generation. 5th son of Guo Tai (Gwok Taai) (国泰). Also known as Er Sheng (Ji Sing) (二勝-諱) and Wen Yong (Man Jung) (文勇).
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Madam Lin (Lam Si) (林氏). Had 7 sons - Shu Zhi (Suk Zi) (叔治), Shu Li (Suk Lai) (叔礼), Shu Wen (Suk Man) (叔文), Shu An (Suk Ngon) (叔安), Shu Wu (Suk Mou) (叔武), Shu Ren (Suk Jan) (叔仁) and Shu Dao (Suk Dou) (叔岛). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the late Song (Sung Hau Kei) (宋后期) Dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 114世。约公元1218前。 国泰公之五子也。諱二胜。又名文勇。
2 CONT
2 CONT 妣林氏, 生子七人, 曰叔治, 叔礼, 叔文, 叔安, 叔武, 叔仁, 叔岛。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Taishan Huang Shi Yin Long Zu Pu (台山黄氏隐龙族谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
