1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 115th generation. 2nd son of Chao Wei (Ciu Wai) (朝威).
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the late Song (Sung Hau Kei) (宋后期) Dynasty. Had 4 sons - Yin Long (Jan Lung) (隐龙-字), Yin Hu (Jan Fu) (隐虎), Yin Bao (Jan Paau) (隐豹) and Teng Long (Tang Lung) (腾龙).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 115世。约公元1158 - 公元1218间。朝威公之次子也。
2 CONT
2 CONT 生子四人也曰, 隐龙, 隐虎, 隐豹, 腾龙。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Taishan Huang Shi Yin Long Zu Pu (台山黄氏隐龙族谱). 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
