1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 117th generation. 1252 to 1341. 2nd son of Yin Long (Jan Lung) (隐龙). Also known as Ba Zhen (Baat Zan) (八真-号).
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife was Madam Deng (Dang Si) (邓氏). Had 2 sons - Chao Xuan (Ciu Syun) (朝选-字) and Chao Ling (Ciu Ling) (朝领). 
2 CONT
2 CONT An Examiner (Kao Zhi) (Haau Zik) (考职) during the Yuan (Jyun) (元) Dynasty. Credited for building the 1st Guanyin Temple (Gun Jam Miu) (观音庙) in Dongkou (Dung Hau) (洞口). The temple is now sandwiched between the shrines of Yin Long (J
2 CONC an Lung) (隐龙) and De Ren (Dak Jan) (德仁).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 117世。公元1252 - 公元1341。隐龙公之次子也。号八真官人。缘例国学生, 考职州同。
2 CONT
2 CONT 妣邓氏, 生子二人曰京(朝选), 领。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Taishan Huang Shi Yin Long Zu Pu (台山黄氏隐龙族谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱). 
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Visits to Yin Long and De Ren shrines and the Guanyin Temple in November 2017, March 2019 and 22 October 2023.
