1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 118th generation. 1271 to 1323. Eldest son of Zhu An (Zuk Am) (竹庵). Also known as Jing (Ging) (京-諱), Qi Xuan (Kei Syun) (期选) and Ti Du (Tai Duk) (提督). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Military Commander of Henan (Ho Naam Tai Duk) (河南提督) during the Yuan (Jyun) (元) Dynasty. Was later promoted to the position of Ronglu Minister (Wing Luk Daai Fu) (荣禄大夫). Returned to his village with honour upon retirement (Jam Mun
2 CONC  Wing Gwai Zi Lei) (任满荣归梓里). Highly respected by the villagers.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Madam Li (Lei SI) (李氏) and had 2 sons - Li Zheng (Lei Zing) (理正-諱) and Li Zhi (Lei Zik) (理直).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 118世。公元1271 - 公元1323。竹庵公之长子也。諱京, 字朝选。别名期选, 提督。
2 CONT
2 CONT 官任河南提督, 晋皆荣禄大夫。任满荣归, 梓里咸敬。
2 CONT
2 CONT 妣李氏, 生二子曰, 里正, 里直。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料來源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Taishan Huang Shi Yin Long Zu Pu (台山黄氏隐龙族谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱). 
