1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 120th generation.Approximately 1352-1427.Son of Yunge(允阁)and Madam Yu(余氏).Also known as Ruifeng(諱-瑞风)and Zhengtang(号-正堂)
2 CONT
2 CONT Achieved the Distinction of being the Top Scholar(進士)In The Early Ming Dynasty(明鄉),Held The Office Of Minister Incharge Of Administrative Affairs(經歷司 )The Ming Dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT Also served as Head Minister Of Rituals And Ceremonies(大禮使)In The Southern Capital Nanjing(南京).
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Madam Zhu(朱氏)and had 6 sons,Yuanheng(元亨),Yuanyu(元誉),Yuanzhen(元貞),Yuanjie(元杰),Yuanjie(元洁),Yuanmei(元美)
