1 NAME 德智 /黄/
2 GIVN 德智
2 SURN 黄
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1342
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1430
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 120th generation. 1342 to 1430. 4th and youngest son of Li Zheng (Lei Zing) (理正). Also known as Heng Zhong (Hang Zung) (亨忠-字). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Born by Madam Yu (Jyu Si) (余氏). Was given to Li Zhi (Lei Zik) (理直), younger brother of Li Zheng, to continue his lineage.
2 CONT
2 CONT Was allowed to succeed both lines in order to care for his biological mother, Madam Yu. Inherited a quarter of Li Zheng's land for that reason. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Madam Wu (Ng Si) (伍). Had 3 sons - Fu Zheng (Fu Zing) (孚政-諱), Fu Shou (Fu Sau) (孚受) and Fu Zhen (FuZan) (孚珍). The descendants from his offspring multiplied and were spread over half of Taishan (Toi Saan) (台山), in Fu Cheng 
2 CONC (Fu Sing) (附城), Shui Bu (Seoi Bou) (水步), San Ba (Saam Baat) (三八), San He (Saam Wo) (三和), Si Jiu (Sei Gau) (四九), Chong Lou (Cung Lau) (冲蒌), Du Hu (Dou Fuk) (都斛), Dou Shan (Dau Saan) (斗山), Guang Hai (Gwong Hoi) (广海), Sha Lan (Saa La
2 CONC an) (沙栏), Hai Yan (Hoi Jin) (海宴), Wen Cun (Man Cyun) (汶村), Shang Chuan (Soeng Cyun) (上川), Xia Chuan (Haa Cyun) (下川) and other villages. By 1921, the number of descendants had already reached 20,000.
2 CONT
2 CONT Director of Studies (Gaau Sau Gun) (教授官) of Guangxi Guilin Prefecture (Gwong Sai Gwai Lam Fu) (广西桂林府) during the Ming (Ming) (明) Dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 120世。公元1342 - 公元1430。 理正公之四子也。諱德智, 字亨忠。
2 CONT
2 CONT 过继理直公, 而正公之田塘, 仍四房均分。
2 CONT
2 CONT 由明经任广西桂林府教谕。
2 CONT
2 CONT 妣伍氏, 生子三人曰孚政, 孚受, 孚珍。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Taishan Huang Shi Yin Long Zu Pu (台山黄氏隐龙族谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱). 
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. 黄氏宗亲网 - 广东黄氏.
