1 NAME HUANG Fu Zheng, WONG Fu Zing, 黄孚政,121,115,11世
1 NAME 孚政,121,115,11世 /黄/
2 GIVN 孚政,121,115,11世
2 SURN 黄
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1358
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1443
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 121st generation. 1358 to 1443. Eldest son of De Zhi (Dak Zi) (德智). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived in different villages at various times - Dong Kou (Dung Hau) (洞口), Guan Tian (Gun Tin) (灌田), Gan Bian (Gam Bin) (甘边), Xin Xia (San Haa) (新霞), Xie Bian (Ze Bin) (谢边), Tang Kou (Tong Hau) (塘口), Ping Yang (Peng Joeng) (平洋), Pan
2 CONC  Long (Pun Lung) (蟠龙), Feng Lou (Fung Lau) (凤楼), Shui Chao (Seoi Ciu) (水潮), Song Zi Ling (Cung Zi Ling)(松仔岭) and  San Jia (Sam Gaap) (三夹).
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife was Madam Zhang (Zoeng Si) (张氏). Had 4 sons - Yue Bao (Ngok Bou) (岳保), Ying Zuo (Jing Zo) (英佐-諱), Chao Zuo (Ciu Zo) (朝佐) and Guan Weng (Gun Jung) (灌翁). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the Yuan (Jyun) (元) and Ming (Ming) (明) Dynasties. Buried in the hill behind Xin Xia village.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 121世。公元1358 - 公元1443。德智公之长子也。諱孚政。
2 CONT
2 CONT 分居洞口, 灌田, 甘边, 新霞, 谢边, 塘口, 平洋, 蟠龙, 凤楼，水潮, 松仔岭, 三夹, 等村。
2 CONT
2 CONT 妣张氏, 生子四人曰, 岳保, 英佐, 朝佐, 灌翁。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Taishan Huang Shi Yin Long Zu Pu (台山黄氏隐龙族谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英房园趣无号支谱).     
