1 NAME HUANG Ying Zuo, WONG Jing Zo, 黄英佐,122,116,12世
1 NAME 英佐,122,116,12世 /黄/
2 GIVN 英佐,122,116,12世
2 SURN 黄
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1376
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1426
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 122nd generation. 1376 to 1426. 2nd son of Fu Zheng (Fu Zing) (孚政). Also known as Jie Chen (Kit San) (杰臣-号).
2 CONT
2 CONT Honest and respectful towards people. Also hardworking and frugal.
2 CONT
2 CONT Was given to Kun Bao (Kwan Bou) (昆宝-諱), youngest son of De Ren (Dak  Jan) (德仁-諱), to continue his lineage.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife was Madam Peng (Paang Si) (彭氏). Had 6 sons - Chun Weng (Seon Jung) (淳翁), Run Weng (Jeon Jung) (润翁), Jun Weng (Zeon Jung) (濬翁), Ze Weng (Zaak Jung) (泽翁), Ling Weng (Ling Jung) (凌翁-諱) and Han Weng (Hon Jung) (汉翁). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the Ming (Ming) (明) Dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT Descendants in Yanjingcun (Ngaan Geng Cyun) (眼镜村) are descended from the Ying Zuo branch.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 122世。公元1376 - 公元1426。孚政公之次子也。諱英佐, 号杰臣。
2 CONT
2 CONT 忠厚待人, 勤俭守己, 生于大明, 其裔由洞口甘边村分居松岭堡, 各村, 三夹, 三叉塘等处。自明时已建公祠于甘边, 至光绪年间重修, 每年正月初九, 我佐祖子孙, 仍回甘边春祭, 每年二月十七, 各房子孙同返洞口拜清。
2 CONT
2 CONT 妣彭氏, 生六子曰, 淳翁, 润翁, 濬翁, 泽翁, 凌翁, 汉翁。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Taishan Huang Shi Yin Long Zu Pu (台山黄氏隐龙族谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱). 
