1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 122nd generation. 3rd son of Fu Zheng (孚政). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Had 2 wives - Madam Zou (鄒氏) and Madam Ye (葉氏) and fathered 7 sons - Man (满), Pan (泮), Yi (益), Xiang (湘), Dong Hai (东海), Nan Jian (南涧) and Xi Hu (西湖).
2 CONT
2 CONT Died at age 73.
2 CONT
2 CONT His descendants settled in Xie Bian (谢边) and Gan Bian (甘边).
2 CONT
