1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 123rd generation. 1399 to 1467. 5th son of Ying Zuo (Jing Zo) (英佐). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wives were Madam Xu (Heoi Si) (许氏) and Madam Bai (Baak Si) (白氏). Had 5 sons - Guan Chang (Gun Coeng) (观长), Guan Rong (Gun Wing) (观荣-諱), Guan Hua (Gun Waa) (观华), Guan An (Gun Ngon) (观安) and Guan Liang (Gun Loeng) (观良). All the sons
2 CONC  were born by Madam Bai who was buried with him.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the Ming (Ming) (明) Dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 123世。公元1399 - 公元1467。英佐公之五子也。諱凌翁。
2 CONT
2 CONT 妣许氏, 续妣白氏, 生子五人曰, 观长, 观荣, 观华, 观安, 观良。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
