1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 124th generation.Lived from 1482 to 1571.Also known as wangsheng(字-旺盛)and Yuanzhen(号-源祯).Fourth son of Yizheng(以政)and Madam Li(李氏)
2 CONT
2 CONT Part of the first generation huangs to be born in Langxi.In the 5th year of Zhengde’s reign(明正德五年)(1510),he became a jinshi(進士),served as minister of justice(官刑部尚书)and minister of revenue(官户部尚书).
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived in Gaolong village(高龍树)and Longan village(龍安树),founding ancestor of the zongsheng branch of the langxi huangs.Married Madam Li(李氏),and had 4 sons,Yi(益),Qin(欽),Xuan(軒)and Jun(俊). 
2 CONT
2 CONT His ancestral tablet was brought to bangka by his descendant Huang Yizhong(黄奕忠)due to increasing unrest in Guangdong during the Qing Dynasty
