1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 124th generation. 1439 to 1527. 2nd son of Ling Weng (Ling Jung) (凌翁). Also known as Yuan Qu (Jyun Ceoi) (园趣-字) and Jia Le (Gaa Lok) (嘉乐-号).
2 CONT
2 CONT Led a simple life  and enjoyed gardening. Renowned for his kindness. Well respected by fellow villagers. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Madam Qu (Wat Si) (屈氏) who bore him 5 sons. Subsequently married Madam Zhen (Jan Si) (甄氏). The 5 sons were Mei Yi (Mui Jik) (梅益), Song Yi (Cung Jik) (松益), Bai Yi (Paak Jik) (柏益), Gui Yi (Gwai Jik) (桂益-字) and Lan Yi (Laan J
2 CONC ik) (兰益). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the Ming (Ming) (明) Dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 124世。公元1439 - 公元1527。凌翁公之次子也。諱观荣, 字园趣, 号嘉乐。
2 CONT
2 CONT 生平不忮不求, 不求闻达, 惟适志蔬园以娱日, 乡称善士。
2 CONT
2 CONT 妣屈氏, 生子五人曰, 梅益, 松益, 柏益, 桂益, 兰益。续妣甄氏, 无子。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Min Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Taishan Huang Shi Yin Long Zu Pu (台山黄氏隐龙族谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱). 
