1 NAME 桂益,125,119,15世 /黄/
2 GIVN 桂益,125,119,15世
2 SURN 黄
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1477
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1557
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 125th generation. 1477 to 1557. 4th son of Guan Rong (Gun Wing) (观荣). Also known as Wen Ming (Man Ming) (文明-字) and Gan Quan (Gam Cyun) (甘泉-号). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Was a scholar dedicated to studying Confucianism during the Ming (Ming) (明) period, but failed in the public examinations. Held a voluntary post in the government.
2 CONT
2 CONT Was involved in compiling the 1st edition of the Xin Ning Dong Kou Huang Shi Zu Pu (San Ning Dung Hau Wong Si Zuk Pou) (新宁洞口黄氏族谱). Our family genealogy book, Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (Man Ming Zou Gaa Pou) (文明祖家谱), was named after him. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Madam Zhang (Zoeng Si) (张氏) who bore him 4 sons - Ru Xue (Jyu Hok) (汝学-字), Ru Gang (Jyu Gong) (汝刚), Ru Bi (Jyu Bat) (汝弼) and Ru Fu (Jyu Fu) (汝辅).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 125世。公元1478 - 公元1559。 观荣公之四子也。諱桂益, 字文明, 号甘泉。
2 CONT
2 CONT 业儒, 科名不就, 缘例义官荣身。
2 CONT
2 CONT 妣张氏, 生字四人曰, 健(汝学), 观(汝刚), 杰(汝弼), 仪端(汝辅)。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
