1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 126th generation. 1501 to 1547. Eldest son of Gui Yi (Gwai Jik) (桂益). Also known as Jian (Gin) (健-諱).
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Madam Zhu (Zyu Si) (朱氏) and Madam Yu (Jyu Si) (余氏). Had 2 sons - Yu Xing (Jyu Haang) (雨行-諱) and Gong Xing (Gung Haang) (公行). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the Ming (Ming) (明) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 126世。公元1501 - 公元1547。桂益公之长子也。諱健, 字汝学。
2 CONT
2 CONT 妣朱氏, 生子二人曰, 雨行, 公行。
2 CONT
