1 NAME HUANG Chao Jin, 黄朝进, 127, 121, 17世 /HUÁNG 黃/
2 GIVN HUANG Chao Jin, 黄朝进, 127, 121, 17世
2 _MARNM HUÁNG 黃
1 SEX M
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 127th generation.Approximately 1570-1647.Son of Qingyin(清隐)and Madam Li(李氏).Also known as Chouwo(字-畴沃)and Zhenyuan(号-真元)
2 CONT
2 CONT One of,if not the last Jinshi produced by the Taishan Wong lineage,prior to the Mid Qing Dynasty.Achieved Distinction Of Top Scholar(進士)in the Late Ming Dynasty.Served in the minister of defense(明官军选授)and was a General Of The Cava
2 CONC lry Troops(骑将军).
2 CONT
2 CONT Participated in many military engagements against the Manchurian’s.Scored some moderate military victories during the early stages of the transition from ming to qing.Favoured by Emperor Chongzhen(崇祯).
2 CONT
2 CONT Contributed Greatly to the war effort against the Manchurians(Qing Dynasty).In 1647,he led one of the last points of resistance against the Qing Dynasty in Guangdong,he died fighting the Qing Army north of Taishan.His status as a 
2 CONC high ranking military commanded in the transition of ming to qing made him and his family vulnerable to the new Qing Dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Qing Soldier’s raided his home in Langxi,stole many of his valuables leaving his wife and children in deep poverty after the war.It wasn’t until his Great-Great Grandson Huang Rongying(黄荣映)who ganed prominence during the Qing 
2 CONC era in Bangka,VOC,that his sacrifices and great contribution to the nation was recognized.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married madam zheng(郑氏)who bored him 5 sons,Hongyu(弘裕),Hongyu(弘遇),Hongshi(弘饰),Hongyao(弘耀)and Hongliang(弘亮).His fourth son Hongyao is an ancestor of the prominent Bangka Huang Lineage which produced the last pair of jinshi’s for
2 CONC  the Taishan Wong Lineage
