1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 127th generation. 1534 to 1608. Eldest son of Ru Xue (Jyu Hok) (汝学). Also known as Pan Gu (Pun Guk) (盘谷-号).
2 CONT
2 CONT Married to Madam Lei (Leoi Si) (雷氏) who bore him 2 sons - Ru Chun (Jyu Seon) (儒淳-諱) and Ru Di (Jyu Dik) (儒迪).
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the Ming (Ming) (明) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 127世。公元1534 - 公元1608。汝学公之长子也。諱雨行, 号盘谷。
2 CONT
2 CONT 妣雷氏, 生子二人曰, 儒淳, 儒廸。
2 CONT
2 CONT 雨行翁是吾祖开枝列后。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Taishan Huang Shi Yin Long Zu Pu (台山黄氏隐龙族谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).      
