1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 128th generation. 1566 to 1628. Eldest son of Yu Xing (Jyu Haang) (雨行). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Madam Li (Lei Si) (李氏). Had 3 sons - Yao De (Jiu Dak) (燿德-諱), Yao Wu (Jiu Mou) (燿武) and Yao Wen (Jiu Man) (燿文). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the late Ming (Ming Hau Kei) (明后期) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 128世。公元1566 - 公元1628。雨行公之长子也。諱儒淳。
2 CONT
2 CONT 妣李氏, 生子三人曰, 耀德, 耀武, 耀文。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
