1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Eldest son of Xia Gu (霞谷). Also Known as Wen Sheng (文盛-号). Married Madam Xie (谢氏).
2 CONT
2 CONT Had 3 sons - Qi Zhen (啟震), Qi Xi (啟禧 and Qi Xuan (啟铉).
2 CONT
2 CONT Relocated with his descendants from Shui Bu Gan Bian Xin Xia village (水步甘边新霞村) to San She Pan Long village (三社蟠龙村).
2 CONT
2 CONT His shrine, known as Wen Sheng Shrine, is located in the village.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources :
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Taishan Huang Shi Yin Long Zu Pu ( 台山黄氏隐龙族谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Jia Pu (黄氏家谱).
