1 NAME Chun Song /HUANG 黄/
2 GIVN Chun Song
2 _MARNM HUANG 黄
1 NAME HUANG Chun Song, WONG Ceon Cung, 黄春松, 131, 125, 21世
1 NAME 春松,131,125,21世 /黄/
2 GIVN 春松,131,125,21世
2 SURN 黄
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1675
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1748
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 131st generation. 1675 to 1748. 2nd son of Wei Ping (Wai Ping) (维屏). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Chun Song (Ceon Cung) (春松) was an itinerant peddler who sold needles and thread, cosmetics, powders and other small necessities from Gan Bian (Gam Bin ) (甘边) to Song Zi Ling (Cung Zai Ling) (松仔岭) and eventually settled in Yanjingc
2 CONC un (Ngaan Geng Cyun) (眼镜村) (Spectacles Village) in 1723. Endured very harsh conditions to establish himself in the village.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dwellings, initially laid out by the hillside, were gradually spread towards the sea. Living conditions slowly improved with agriculture and grazing and the population grew rapidly. Between 1723 and 1800, four generations of desce
2 CONC ndants (Xue, Hok, 学; Hong, Wang, 宏; Zun, Zyun, 尊 and Chao, Ciu, 朝) were born. Male descendants from the Chao generation alone totalled  more than 70. Yanjingcun expanded in size rapidly and relatives from other Ying Zuo (Jing Zo) 
2 CONC (英佐) branches were invited to share in the prosperity.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1st wife was Madam Ye (Jip Si) (葉氏), succeeded by 2nd wife, Madam Liang (Loeng Si) (梁氏). Had 4 sons - Chang Xue (Soeng Hok) (常学), Qing Xue (Cing Hok) (清学), Fu Xue (Fu Hok) (富学-諱) and En Xue (Jan Hok) (恩学).
2 CONT
2 CONT Based on the records in our Family Genealogy Book (Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu, 文明祖家谱), he was buried in Song Zi Ling. Unfortunately, his grave is yet to be found.
2 CONT
2 CONT His shrine (Ci Tong) (祠堂) is located in the village. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the Qing (Cing) (清) Dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 2024, his shrine was spruced at a cost of RMB65,000 paid by Huang Kuang Shun (David Wong Khong Soon) (Wong Hong Seon) (黄匡顺) from Johor Baru (Xin Shan) (San Saan) (新山), Johor (Rou Fo) (Jau Fat) (柔佛), Malaysia (Mal Lai Xi Ya) (Ma
2 CONC a Loi Sai Aa) (马来西亚).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 131世。公元1675 - 公元1748。维屏公之次子也。諱春松。
2 CONT
2 CONT 妣叶氏, 生子三人曰, 常学, 清学, 富学。续妣梁氏, 生一子恩学。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Taishan Huang  Shi Yin Long Zu Pu (台山黄氏隐龙族谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Visits to Chun Song Shrine (春松词堂) in November 2017, March 2019, 23 October 2023 (重阳节) and 11 October 2024 (重阳节).
