2 _MARNM HUANG 黄
1 NAME HUANG Fu Xue, WONG Fu Hok, 黄富学,132,126, 22世
1 NAME 富学,132,126,22世 /黄/
2 GIVN 富学,132,126,22世
2 SURN 黄
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1709
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1754
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 132nd generation. 1709 to 1754. 3rd son of Chun Song (Ceon Cung) (春松). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Relocated with his father, Chun Song, from Gan Bian (Gam Bin) (甘边) to Yanjingcun (Ngaan Geng Cyun) (眼镜村) at the young age of 14. Lived under very harsh conditions in Yanjingcun during the Qing (清) period. Died relatively young at 
2 CONC age 45.
2 CONT
2 CONT Had only one son, Hong Rang (Wang Joeng) (宏讓-字), by wife, Madam Zhao (Ziu Si) (趙氏).
2 CONT
2 CONT He and his wife were buried in separate graves near Yanjingcun. According to accounts from the relatives in Yanjingcun, Madam Zhao saw a bright glow on the hill from her bedroom window before her death and she instructed her desce
2 CONC ndants to bury her there. The villagers believe that the burial site has good feng shui (fung seoi) (风水). Indeed, the grave site has a commanding view of the village, overlooking the village shrine below. The surrounding landscape
2 CONC  resembles a lion looking at a river.
2 CONT
2 CONT Fu Xue's (Fu Hok's) (富学) grave was rebuilt and expanded in April 2020 by the descendants in Yanjingcun. The gravesite of Fu Xue (Rat Hill, Shu Shan, Syu Saan, 鼠 山) is one of the 4 gravesites where our ancestors in Yanjingcun were 
2 CONC buried. The other three are Wang Jiang Shi (Mong Gong Si, 望江狮), where Fu Xue's wife (Madam Zhao, Ziu Si, 赵氏) was buried; Song Zi Ling (Cung Zai Ling, 松仔岭) where Hong Rang (Wang Joeng, 宏让) and his wife were buried; and Tiger Hill (
2 CONC Fu Saan, 虎山), where Wong Ah Fook's mother (Madam Mai, Mak Si, 麦氏) was buried. In 2020, Madam Mai's remains were re-buried next to Fu Hok's grave because Tiger Hill was flattened for development. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 132世。公元1709 - 公元1754。春松公之三子也。諱富学。
2 CONT
2 CONT 松翁迁徒之余几于家无升斗矣其至甘边乡迁松岭居眼睛村者此中之艰难险阻而我富学翁定相与共嘗焉当其时日食不给兼之无禄早世而何有於蒸嘗以为子孙长久之计乎。
2 CONT
2 CONT 妣赵氏, 生一子曰源思(宏让)。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Taishan Huang Shi Yin Long Zu Pu (台山黄氏隐龙族谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Grave sites visits on 14 March 2019, 23 October 2023 (重阳节) and 11 October 2024 (重阳节).
