1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 134th generation. 1785 to 1848. 2nd son of Hong Rang (Wang Joeng) (宏讓). Also known as Gou (Gau) (狗) and Tian Chi (Tin Ci) (天池-号). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Madam Cao (Cou Si) (曹氏) who bore him 4 sons - Mao Chao (Mau Ciu) (懋朝-字), Xian Chao (Hin Ciu) (显朝-字), Pan Chao (Pun Ciu) (泮朝-字) and Chi Chao (Ci Ciu) (炽朝-字).
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the Qing (Cing) (清) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 134世。公元1785 - 公元1848。宏讓翁之次子也。名狗, 字鹏尊, 号天池。
2 CONT
2 CONT 妣曹氏, 生子四人曰, 士英(懋朝), 士秀(显朝), 士良(泮朝), 士贞(炽朝)。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
