1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 135th generation. 1821 to 1886. 2nd son of Peng Zun (Paang Zyun) (鹏尊). Also known as Shi Xiu (Si Sau) (士秀-諱) and Yi Xuan (Jik Hin) (奕轩-号).
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Madam Zhao (Ziu Si) (趙氏) who died at age 29 and bore him two sons - Yan Ting (Hin Ting) (衍廷) and Yan Ji (Hin Gei) (衍基). Yan Ting died young.
2 CONT
2 CONT The existence of Yan Ting (through his ancestral tablet, Shen Zhu Pai, San Zyu Paai, 神主牌) was discovered by chance when I entered my Grandfather's former residence in Yanjingcun (Ngaan Geng Cyun) (眼镜村) on 23 October 2023 (重阳节). It
2 CONC  was probably because of his early death that his name was not included in the Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT Great Great Great Grandfather's ancestral tablet was also found in Grandfather's former residence on 23 October 2023 together with those of his son, Yan Ting,  and his grandson, Yu Shi (Jyu Sai) (裕世).
2 CONT
2 CONT Went back to Yanjingcun on 11 October 2024 (重阳节) to place the tablets on a table under shelter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the late Qing (Cing Hau Kei) (清后期) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 135世。公元1821 - 公元1886。鹏尊翁之次子也。諱士秀, 字显朝, 号奕轩。
2 CONT
2 CONT 妣赵氏, 生子二人曰衍廷 (早逝) 和衍基。
2 CONT
2 CONT 活于清后期。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.  Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱). This is our Family Genealogy Book, named after our ancestor, Wen Ming (Man Ming) (文明), that records our family history and lineage.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Taishan Huang Shi Yin Long Zu Pu (台山黄氏隐龙族谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱). 
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.  Ancestral tablets (神主牌) of Great Great Great Grandfather, Xian Chao (Hin Ciu) (显朝), Great Great Grand Uncle, Yan Ting (Hin Ting) (衍廷) and Great Grandfather, Yu Shi (Jyu Sai) (裕世) discovered during my visit to my Grandfather's 
2 CONC former residence in Yanjingcun (Ngaan Geng Cyun) (眼镜村) on 23 October 2023 (重阳节).
