2 CONT  https://books.google.com.my/books?id=PIgGCwAAQBAJ&pg=PA318&lpg=PA318&dq=Wong+Fook+Kee++Wong+Ah+Fook&source=bl&ots=E-MGfXUEAd&sig=JQLHwVvmgEjMyful2almki1re-Q&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwjli8z2hYPMAhVQwI4KHdWxBD4Q6AEIKTAD#v=onepage&q=Won
2 CONC g%20Fook%20Kee%20%20Wong%20Ah%20Fook&f=false
2 CONT
2 CONT http://books.google.com.sg/books?id=8doSNe5SLkgC&pg=PA118&lpg=PA118&dq=Wong+Ah+Fook&source=bl&ots=2wq6ddxhmp&sig=sQkPPIWwFbvKEce7bRIz5xhIt7Y&hl=en&sa=X&ei=9NyAUO7MHY3rrQf83YGoDQ&ved=0CFYQ6AEwBw#v=onepage&q=Wong%20Ah%20Fook&f=true
2 CONT
2 CONT Oral History in Southeast Asia: Theory and Method: Biography of Wong Fook Kee
2 CONT Born in Yanjingcun (眼镜村), (Spectacles Village) in Taishan, Guangzho, China
2 CONT Arrived in Singapore in 1854
2 CONT
2 CONT relative of WONG Ah Fook - https://www.geni.com/people/Fatimah-bt-Abdullah-Sultanah/6000000002322833026?through=6000000210209654838
2 CONT
2 CONT last place of residence: 72 Keng Lee Rd.. off Newton
2 CONT
2 CONT Vivienne Wong:
2 CONT Part of WAF ‘s longevity was his frugality. He ate sparingly. According to my grandfather, he and wife had only 2 meals a day and shared a cube of fermented soya bean ( fu Yee). On their birthday, they shared a salted duck’s egg.
