1 NAME HUANG Yan Ji, WONG Hin Gei, 黄衍基,136, 130, 26世
1 NAME 洐基 /黄/
2 GIVN 洐基
2 SURN 黄
1 SEX M
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 136th generation. Son of Xian Chao (Hin Ciu) (显朝).
2 CONT
2 CONT Had an elder brother, Yan Ting (Hin Ting) (衍廷), who died young (either still born or during infancy). As a result of his brother's early death, the generation character Ting (廷) was probably not used for his name. His name became 
2 CONC Yan Ji (Hin Gei) (衍基) as a result.
2 CONT
2 CONT Had only one son - Yu Shi (Jyu Sai) (裕世). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the late Qing (清后期) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT 136世。显朝之子。
2 CONT
2 CONT 有个早逝的哥哥名衍廷。他的名字本应有个字辈为廷。可能因为哥哥的早逝,廷字就没被用了。所以他的名字被取为衍基。
2 CONT
2 CONT 生子一人曰裕世。
2 CONT
2 CONT 活于清后期。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Taishan Huang Shi Yin Long Zu Pu (台山黄氏隐龙族谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.  Huang Zhi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱). 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  Ancestral tablet (San Zyu Paai) (神主牌) of Yan Ting was discovered during my visit to my Grandfather's former residence in Yanjingcun (Ngaan Geng Cyun) (眼镜村) on 23 October 2023 (重阳节).
