1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.genealogy.com/ftm/p/e/t/Mike-Pettet-London/BOOK-0001/0007-0003.html
2 CONT
2 CONT 柔佛振利美菸酒公司的助理經理'''黃亞炎（黃光炎）'''是亞福的侄兒，在較後的廣益銀行股東名單中有他的名字, 他與亞福經常一同出席柔佛皇家宴會，蘇丹依布拉欣（Sultan Ibrahim）是亞炎的同學
2 CONT
2 CONT 亞炎於1924年2月26日與世長辭，享年五十有六；3月3日舉殯，葬於碧山亭。
2 CONT
2 CONT Wong Ah Yam married eldest daughter of "Mak Ah Chi", "Mak Jee Koo" (Mak Pek Ngiew??) in 1911:
2 CONT http://eresources.nlb.gov.sg/newspapers/Digitised/Article/weeklysun19110812-1.2.13?ST=1&AT=search&k=wong%20ah%20yam&P=4&Display=0&filterS=0&QT=wong,ah,yam&oref=article
2 CONT
2 CONT She passed away in 1935:
2 CONT http://eresources.nlb.gov.sg/newspapers/Digitised/Article/singfreepressb19350829-1.2.40?ST=1&AT=search&k=Wong%20ah%20Yam&QT=wong,ah,yam&oref=article
2 CONT
2 CONT http://eresources.nlb.gov.sg/newspapers/Digitised/Article/straitstimes19350902-1.2.126?ST=1&AT=search&k=wong%20ah%20yam%20mak&QT=wong,ah,yam,mak&oref=article
2 CONT
2 CONT Wong Ah Yam also married Mak Jee Koo's sister, "Mak Kwi Tong", she passed away in 1955:
2 CONT http://eresources.nlb.gov.sg/newspapers/Digitised/Article/straitstimes19550613-1.2.74?ST=1&AT=search&k=MAK%20Kwi%20Tong&QT=mak,kwi,tong&oref=article
2 CONT
2 CONT 'Ng Soon Lan', 3rd wife passed away 1971:
2 CONT http://eresources.nlb.gov.sg/newspapers/Digitised/Article/straitstimes19711124-1.2.152?ST=1&AT=search&k=wong%20ah%20yam&QT=wong,ah,yam&oref=article
2 CONT
2 CONT Message from
2 CONT "Managers of Wong Kwong Yam (Wong Ah Yam),
2 CONT
2 CONT I am contacting you about this profile: https://www.geni.com/people/Wong-Kwong-Yam-Wong-Ah-Yam/600000000079...
2 CONT
2 CONT Wong Kwong Yam's burial place is now in the Tiong Hua Memorial Park at Jalan Ulu Air Molek, Johor Bahru.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sincerely,
2 CONT Sook Jin Goh
2 CONT
2 CONT HP: +601137361183
2 CONT Email: gohbrenntag@gmail.com
2 CONT
2 CONT  Wong Kwong Yam (Wong Ah Yam)"
