1 NAME Yù Shì, Yu Sai /HUANG 黄/
2 GIVN Yù Shì, Yu Sai
2 _MARNM HUANG 黄
1 NAME HUANG Yù Shì, WONG Yu Sai, 黄裕世,137,131, 27世
1 NAME 裕世 /黄/
2 GIVN 裕世
2 SURN 黄
1 SEX M
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 137th generation. Only son of Yan Ji (Hin Gei) (衍基). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Great Grandfather of Rex Wong (Jun Quan) (Gwan Kyun) (Kwan Kuan) (君权).
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the end-Qing (Qing Mo) (Cing Mut) (清末) period. Married Madam Li (Lei Si) (李氏) who bore him only one son, Lian Deng, (Lin Dang) (连登), to continue the lineage.
2 CONT
2 CONT Buried in Johor Baru, Malaysia (San Saan) (新山), (Ma Loi Sai Aa) (马来西亚). Unfortunately, the tomb was destroyed when the cemetery was demolished for urban development.
2 CONT
2 CONT His ancestral tablet (San Zyu Paai) (神主牌) was found inside Grandfather's former residence in Yanjingcun (Ngaan Geng Cyun) (眼镜村) on 23 October 2023.
2 CONT
2 CONT Went back to Grandfather's former residence on 11 October 2024 (重阳节) to place his tablet on a table under shelter. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 137世。衍基之子。
2 CONT
2 CONT 妣李氏。生一子曰连登。
2 CONT
2 CONT 活于清末。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) - 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.  Taishan Huang Shi Yin Long Zu Pu (台山黄氏隐龙族谱). This is the Taishan Huang Clan Genealogy Book that details all the lineages that are linked to Yin Long (Jan Lung) (隐龙).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.  Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).  
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  Ancestral Tablet of Yu Shi discovered during my visit to my Grandfather's former residence in Yanjingcun on 23 October 2023 (重阳节).
