2 CONT '''From Paddy CHEE:'''
2 CONT I am the eldest grandson of Kwan Ying Siong , from his first wife. Kwan Ying Siong had FOUR wives : his first wife is my grandmother.
2 CONT Gladys is the daughter from Kwan Ying Siong’s second wife 
2 CONT Then Gladys Kwan married another Chee not related to my family . Hence became Gladys Chee. 
2 CONT Gladys Chee passed away many many years ago around 41 years ago , died young from cancer . Her husband passed away too . Her eldest son has disappeared. Her youngest son Lionel Chee is still alive in Singapore.
2 CONT Kwan Ying Siong was running a company called San Holdings
