2 CONT
2 CONT ''The Straits Times : Weekly Overseas Edition 25 May 1996 File pictures.  Microfilm Reel NL20732''
2 CONT Badminton ace WONG Peng Soon dies By Joe Dorai SINGAPORE'S best known sportsman. Mr WONG Peng Soon, died on Wednesday morning. He was 78. The four-time All-England singles badminton champion died of pneumonia at the Toa Payoh Hosp
2 CONC ital. He was taken to the hospital from the East Coast Medicare Centre
