1 NAME Lián Dēng /HUANG 黄/
2 GIVN Lián Dēng
2 _MARNM HUANG 黄
1 NAME HUANG Lián Dēng, WONG Lin Dang, 黄连登,138,132, 28世
1 NAME 连登 /黄/
2 GIVN 连登
2 SURN 黄
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1891
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1978
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 138th generation. 1891 to 1978. Only son of Yu Shi (Yu Sai) (裕世). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Grandfather of Rex Wong (Jun Quan) (Kwan Kyun) (Kwan Kuan) (君权). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Yanjingcun (Ngaan Geng Cyun) (眼镜村). After his father's early death, joined his grand uncle, Huang Ya Fu (Wong Aa Fuk) Wong Ah Fook (黄亚福), in Singapore to work. Was an Assistant Manager in Luo Qi Sheng (Lo Kei Saang) (罗奇生).
2 CONC  Subsequently also invested in tin mines in Perak, Malaya (now Peninsular Malaysia), and primary produce in North Borneo (now Sabah). From 1964 to 1969 he was in the Board of Directors of Ning Yang Hui Kuan (Ning Joeng Wui Gun) (宁
2 CONC 阳会馆) in Singapore.
2 CONT
2 CONT Had 2 wives who lived with him. No.1 wife was Madam Zeng Shuang Feng (Zang Soeng Fung) (曾双鳳) who bore him 3 sons - Meng Fang (Mang Fong) (孟芳), Meng Hua (Mang Waa) (孟华), Meng Wei (Mang Wai) (孟伟) - and one daughter, Shu Lan (Syu Lan
2 CONC ) (树兰).  Had 16 grandchildren. No. 2 wife was called Sai Maa (literally means "junior granny") by the grandchildren, but did not bear any children.
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in Singapore and his niche is beside that of his wife, Madam Zeng, in Kwong Wai Siew Peck San Theng Columbarium (Gwong Wai Siu Bik Saan Ting) (广惠肇碧山亭).
2 CONT
2 CONT His former residence is still in Yanjingcun but is in a state of disrepair. Found the ancestral tablets (San Zyu Paai) (神主牌) of Great Great Great Grandfather (Xian Chao, Hin Ciu, 显朝), Great Great Granduncle (Yan Ting, Hin Ting, 衍廷
2 CONC ) and Great Grandfather (Yu Shi, Jyu Sai, 裕世) when I went inside my Grandfather's former residence on 23 October 2023 (重阳节).
2 CONT
2 CONT Went back to my Grandfather's former residence again on 11 October 2024 (重阳节) to place the ancestral tablets on a table under shelter.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) - 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.  Taishan Huang Shi Yin Long Zu Pu (台山黄氏隐龙族谱). This is the Taishan Huang clan genealogy book that details all the lineages that are linked to Yin Long (Jan Lung) (隐龙).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.  Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱). 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  Personal knowledge.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.  Visits to his former residence in Yanjingcun on 23 October 2023 (重阳节) and 11 October 2024 (重阳节).
