2 CONT Sir Richard John Peter Jenks, 4th Bt. was born in June 1936. He is the son of Sir Richard Atherley Jenks, 2nd Bt. and Marjorie Suzanne Arlette du Cros. He married Juniper Li-Yung Foo, daughter of Tan Sri Y. C. Foo, on 18 July 1963
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Richard John Peter Jenks, 4th Bt. usually went by his middle name of Peter. He was educated at Charterhouse School, Godalming, Surrey, England. He gained the rank of officer in the 5th Royal Inniskilling Dragoon Guards. He was
2 CONC  appointed Fellow, Institute of Chartered Accountants (F.C.A.) He lived in 2003 at 81 Onslow Square, London, EnglandG. He succeeded as the 4th Baronet Jenks in 2006. Children of Sir Richard John Peter Jenks, 4th Bt. and Juniper Li
2 CONC -Yung Foo:
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard Albert Benedict Jenks. 27 Feb 1965
2 CONT
2 CONT Melissa Kate Rosalind Jenks. 28 Feb 1967
2 CONT
2 CONT Serena Anne Louise Jenks. 7 Jul 1970
2 CONT
