1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Paddy CHEE (2025):
2 CONT Gladys is the daughter from Kwan Ying Siong’s second wife 
2 CONT Then Gladys Kwan married another Chee not related to my family . Hence became Gladys Chee. 
2 CONT Gladys Chee passed away many many years ago around 41 years ago , died young from cancer . Her husband passed away too . Her eldest son has disappeared. Her youngest son Lionel Chee is still alive in Singapore
2 CONT
2 CONT The Straits Times / Obituary, Illustration
2 CONT Lock icon Untitled
2 CONT 22 November 2008 - SECOND ANNIVERSARY IN LOVING MEMORY OF GLADYS KWAN YAM PING Departed on 22 Nov 2006 Sleeping peacefully resting at last in heaven. In silence she suffered, In patience she bore. Till God called her home to suffe
2 CONC r no more. Fondly remembered by Husband: Victor Chee, Sons: Ronnie Lionel, Grandchildren, Relatives
2 CONT 52 words 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT The Straits Times / Obituary, Illustration
2 CONT Lock icon Untitled
2 CONT 23 November 2006 - "The Lord is my Shepherd, I shall not be m want. He makes me lie down m green pastures, he leads me beside quiet waters, he restores my soul. Psalm 23 GLADYS KWAN YAM PING AGE: 64 was called home to be with die 
2 CONC Lord on 22 Nov 2006 leaving
2 CONT 438 words 
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of: Ying Siong Kwan and KWOK Hung Keng
2 CONT Wife of: Victor Chee
2 CONT Mother of: Lionel Chee and Ronnie Chee
2 CONT Sister of: Yam Kuan, Doris Kwan
2 CONT Half sister of: Ah Hee Lim; Chek Tham; Kam Choon Lim; Oi Ming Lim; Pau Sang Tham Wong; and William Tham« less 
