1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Phila Mae Wong set off to the US for her university studies in 1961. In her teens, she had already become a competitive bowler, balance beam gymnast and one of Singapore’s champion water skiers. As a little girl, e
2 CONC ncouraged by her mother, she would re-design all her dolls’ clothes so that they would look more modern.
2 CONT
2 CONT Before Wong could graduate from university, she became an associate buyer for her mother’s fashion imports shop named Vanity Fair at Raffles Place, and even started her own boutique
2 CONT
