1 NAME Mèng Wěi /HUANG 黄/
2 GIVN Mèng Wěi
2 _MARNM HUANG 黄
2 NICK WONG Tong Goon
1 NAME HUANG Meng Wei, WONG Mang Wai, 黄孟伟,139,133, 29世
1 NAME 孟伟 /黄/
2 GIVN 孟伟
2 SURN 黄
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1925
1 DEAT
2 DATE 2006
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''WONG Tong Goon (黄东源) - Singapore Table Tennis player'''
2 CONT
2 CONT 139th generation. 1925 to 2006. Born in Jesselton (now Kota Kinabalu), North Borneo (now Sabah). 3rd and youngest son of Lian Deng (Lin Dang) (连登). Also known as Wong Tong Goon (Wong Dung Jyun) (黄东源). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived briefly in Yanjingcun (Ngaan Geng Cyun) (眼镜村) with his parents and his siblings during his teenage years.
2 CONT
2 CONT Represented Singapore in Table Tennis under the name of TG Wong in the 1950s. Was a member of the Singapore Table Tennis Team in the Asian Championships in 1954. The Singapore Team emerged as the silver medalists.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Tan Xiu Qiong (Taam Sau King) (Tham Siow Keng) (谭秀琼). Had 5 sons - Jun Hao (Gwan Hou) (Kuen Hoe) (Carlo Wong) (君豪), Jun Quan (Gwan Kyun) (Kwan Kuan) (Rex Wong) (君权), Jun Chang (Gwan Coeng) (Kwan Cheong) (Sunny Wong) (君昌), 
2 CONC Jun Ying (Gwan Jing) (KwanYing) (Toni Wong) (君英) and Jun Yao (Gwan Jiu) (KwanYew) (David Wong) (君耀)(Gwan Jiu), 9 grandchildren and one great grandson. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Worked in Cathay Pacific Airways from the 1960s until his retirement. Managed a travel agency in partnership with friends until the late 1980s.
2 CONT
2 CONT Died of heart attack while holidaying in Batam in 2006.
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.  Taishan Huang Shi Yin Long Zu Pu (台山黄氏隐龙族谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.  Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱). 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  Personal knowledge.
2 CONT
2 CONT wife's death
